{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14231250","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14231250","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1423125001:1":{"text":"So, what do you think?","source_cn":"看看注魔后的天青矿锻造出的成品，还满意吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3EAC5868B0DDA4BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1423125002:1":{"text":"Hmm, let me see. A-Are you sure this isn't made from echorites?!","source_cn":"嗯……我看看。这、这确定不是用深岩晶锻造的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x661BBBCA07D39C7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:2::2":{"text":"","source_cn":"","status":"matched_item_resource","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423125003:1":{"text":"Teota and Hawke, look at this!","source_cn":"铁哥达，哈卡，你们也来看看。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x165D038CD8EBB07A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423125004:1":{"text":"Wow, this sword is terrific! The blade is sharp and sturdy!","source_cn":"好一把削铁如泥的宝剑！既锋利，又韧性十足！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88A4E422138A2001","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423125005:1":{"text":"How can it be so light but so tough at the same time? Unbelievable...","source_cn":"而且重量是怎么做到如此之轻的？能保持硬度和韧性的同时，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFCCCC1179FA7456","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423125006:1":{"text":"Not even swords forged from regular echorites come close...","source_cn":"普通深岩晶锻造的剑都达不到这样的程度……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9B34D6D1AD4DA7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1423125007:1":{"text":"Ironbeard, this arcane steel is no joke!","source_cn":"大哥，这魔钢有点东西啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x773FC06A242CBDDA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1423125008:1":{"text":"If it can be mass-produced, it'll be the ideal substitute for echorite...","source_cn":"要是能大批量投产的话，确实能替代深岩晶……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9306DE0095E78366","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1423125009:1":{"text":"But that's not possible with just the Magister doing the infusion.","source_cn":"可是就<male>他</male><female>她<...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF5E24FC1353AF41B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"But that's not possible with just the Magister doing the infusion.","female":"But that's not possible with just the Magister doing the infusion.","variant_male_record_index":"170338","variant_female_record_index":"170339","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1423125010:1":{"text":"Once the production line is up and running, we'll need thousands of the arcane steel, not just one or two!","source_cn":"等生产线运转起来，要的可不是一两块魔钢，而是成千上万块！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA4A28AA1580C9BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1423125011:0":{"text":"That's where the collaboration with Sal'thorin comes in. Many of the Essail there are mages, so they can help us with the magic!","source_cn":"所以祖娅和我想推进和萨洛克兰的合作，那里有大批会魔法的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F074CB65A81948C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1423125012:1":{"text":"Hmph, I suppose they won't be helping us for free, huh?","source_cn":"哼，要是无利可图的话，他们怎么会愿意做这些？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A06949516CB7E1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1423125012":{"text":"Hmph, I suppose they won't be helping us for free, huh?","source_cn":"哼，要是无利可图的话，他们怎么会愿意做这些？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A06949516CB7E1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title